A narrow student's cell under a sloped ceiling: a bed with unfamiliar sheets, a desk, a trunk you have not finished unpacking. Moonlight through the single lancet window finds the door to the north, standing just ajar.
Exits: north.
You see: candle, wand.
> You step forward. A long panelled corridor, doors shut on either side and the ceiling lost in the dark. Somewhere far off a stair creaks to itself. A lamp in a wall bracket kindles quietly as you approach, and the way south leads back to your cell.

A key lies on the floor, catching the lamplight.
Exits: north, south, up.
You see: key.
HP: 12/12 · Stun: ready · Ward: ready
> A long panelled corridor, doors shut on either side and the ceiling lost in the dark. Somewhere far off a stair creaks to itself. A lamp in a wall bracket kindles quietly as you approach, and the way south leads back to your cell.

The goblin grunt lunges from the shadow of a doorway, striking at you. It hauls back for another blow, and the wind-up shows plain in its shoulders. You slip inside the swing and land a glancing hit—not much, but it chips at the thing.

Below the lamp, a key waits on the floor.
HP: 11/12 · Stun: ready · Ward: ready
> The goblin grunt lunges again, blade cutting for you. You turn it aside and strike back; the creature buckles and goes still.

A long panelled corridor, doors shut on either side and the ceiling lost in the dark. Somewhere far off a stair creaks to itself. A lamp in a wall bracket kindles quietly as you approach, and the way south leads back to your cell.

On the floor lie a key and a fire grimoire. The corridor runs north and up, and south back the way you came.
